{"title": "Actor", "pageid": 8366, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Actor", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Perform_Whistle.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Perform_Whistle.webp/300px-Perform_Whistle.webp, /w/images/9/96/Perform_Whistle.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Perform_Whistle.webp/300px-Perform_Whistle.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Perform_Whistle.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Actor</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> that grants bonuses to a character's ability to act.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have become a true thespian. Your <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> increases by 1, to a maximum of 20<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup>. Your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Bonus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a> is doubled for Deception and Performance <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Granted as a <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> earned at level 4, 8, or 12.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feat effectively grants expertise in Deception and Performance, without requiring proficiency. It does not add bonuses to these checks on top of existing expertise.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The ability score increase is uncapped and can increase Charisma beyond the stated maximum of 20.\n<ul><li>However, it may not stack with other capped Charisma bonuses when Charisma is above 20, see <a href=\"/wiki/Abilities#Priority\" title=\"Abilities\">here</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195740\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 634/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4201/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2811/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643642/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.278      1